  "question": {
    "text": "The motion of a simple pendulum executing S.H.M. is represented by the following equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where time is measured in second. The length of pendulum is",
